PROPOSED (NOT APPLIED) minimal hook for experiments/ab_smooth_vs_bangbang/mpc_fl.py.
ValueFLMPC (flmpc_value.py) currently gets the same effect by swapping the module
global `mpc_fl.sc` for a solver proxy during step(); this patch would make that
unnecessary. Default extra_rows=None -> byte-identical behaviour for every caller.

